# h700 (Anbernic RG35XX Plus / RG35XX-H) — Allwinner sun50iw9, 4x Cortex-A53, aarch64.
# Same toolchain family as tg5040; the recon binaries (panelprobe, hellofb) were built with the
# tg5040 docker image and ran on-device. A dedicated toolchain image comes with the boot-image work.
#
# No GOV_PLATFORM_* define yet: governor.c's default branch is the tg5040/schedutil model, which is
# exactly what this SoC offers (schedutil confirmed in scaling_available_governors, 2026-08-04).
# Add a platform block only when a measured receipt says the default is wrong here.
ARCH = -mcpu=cortex-a53 -mtune=cortex-a53
